---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/seo';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="IMU Calculator Cookies in Italy: No Cookies on This Site" description="IMU calculator cookies: the site sets none and keeps no cadastral income or rate on your device. Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free, only checks anonymously that it works." lang={lang} noindex={true} jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: route('home', lang) }, { name: 'Cookies', path: route('cookies', lang) }])]} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]}>
  <header class="mb-6"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 md:text-4xl">Cookies</h1></header>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <p>AliquoteIMU.it sets no cookie of any kind, first-party or third-party. The cadastral income, category, ownership share and rate you enter stay in the open page (and, if you use the share link, in its address): nothing is saved on your device, not even in the browser’s local storage, and closing the tab leaves no trace. Since there is nothing to accept, you will not see a cookie banner. The legal details are in the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Categories</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Strictly necessary cookies</td><td>none</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Analytics or profiling cookies</td><td>none</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Advertising</td><td>none</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Technical stability check (Microsoft Clarity)</td><td>cookie-free, content masked</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Anonymous stability check</h2>
    <p>To notice when a comune rate page fails to load, the calculator throws an error or a button does nothing, the site runs Microsoft Clarity in cookie-free mode. In that mode Clarity sets no <code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>, <code>MUID</code> or <code>CLID</code>: every page view gets a throwaway identifier, visits are not linked to one another, and page text and typed values are masked before anything is sent. It only measures errors, load times, clicks that do nothing and scrolling. The publisher records no personal data.</p>

    <h2>Blocking it anyway</h2>
    <p>Block the <code>clarity.ms</code> domain in your browser or with a content blocker: the IMU calculation works exactly the same. Questions: use the address given in the privacy policy.</p>
    <p>Last updated: 6 October 2026.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
